WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.390
Gold drops ten dollars – and your account is empty?

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.660
Leverage: little capital, big position. Losses included.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:16.850
Step one: With leverage of one to five hundred, eight hundred dollars buys one lot.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.540
Step two: Ten dollars down – minus one thousand. Account gone.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:28.600
Step three: Leverage is just permission. Your risk sets the size.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.450
Typical mistake: Free margin doesn't mean one more trade.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.490
I show my planning live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
